# Mass Target Emails Configuration
# This file is used with the send-teams and send-email commands for mass sending
# Format: One recipient per line
# Lines starting with # are comments and will be ignored
# Empty lines are also ignored

# Email addresses
john.doe@example.com
alice.wonder@example.com
bob.wilson@example.com

# User aliases from humans.conf
john
alice
bobby

# Conversation names from conversations.conf (for send-teams only)
Equipe_Dev
Support_Client

# Channel names from conversations.conf (for send-teams only)
Canal_General
Canal_Dev

# Mixed recipients (emails, aliases, conversations, channels)
# toto.smith@example.com
# momo
# Equipe_Marketing

# You can also use multi-word aliases (use quotes in the CLI if needed)
# john doe

# This is a comment line and will be skipped
# jane@example.com
